WEBVTT

00:21:59.527 --> 00:22:02.000
he disappears, a bunch of money is lost,

00:22:02.024 --> 00:22:05.340
and she, who has just been a secretary
to an executive her whole life,

00:22:05.364 --> 00:22:07.599
is sent down to figure everything out.

00:22:07.623 --> 00:22:09.962
The book was to be called
"Evelyn of the Amazon."

00:22:09.986 --> 00:22:12.791
I was working on that book,
I got a contract for that book,

00:22:12.815 --> 00:22:14.453
I was doing research on that book.

00:22:14.477 --> 00:22:19.872
And around that time,
I went to speak at a conference

00:22:19.896 --> 00:22:22.578
and I met the novelist
Ann Patchett for the first time.

00:22:22.602 --> 00:22:25.116
And she and I took one look at each other

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:28.583
and became, like, devoted
in-love-with-each-other friends,

00:22:28.607 --> 00:22:31.132
heard each other speak
and were dazzled by each other.